00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:04.180
Leah: The KISS Principle is a term that
is widely used in a variety of different

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.090
industries so let’s look at what it
means especially in relation to coding.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:15.969
KISS is an acronym for a design principle
noted by the US Navy in 1960 and it stands

00:00:15.969 --> 00:00:20.270
for ‘Keep it Simple and Straightforward’
and covers many different areas of design

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.230
including engineering and programming.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:26.630
There are other variations of this
including ‘keep it short and simple’

00:00:26.929 --> 00:00:28.589
and ‘keep it simple, stupid’.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.610
Whatever way it is used
it means the same thing.

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:36.159
Jack: ‘Keep it simple stupid’ or
even ‘keep it stupid simple’ are

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.839
most commonly used in programming.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.720
By keeping the programming simple,
service and maintenance are much

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:45.940
easier and there are no hard and fast
rules regarding the implementation

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.830
of code, only that it should be
simple and therefore easily modified.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:53.720
There are many reasons for
implementing this philosophy.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:58.379
It may prevent you from wasting time and
effort developing complicated protocols

00:00:58.390 --> 00:00:59.850
which take a long time to write.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.820
However, the primary benefits,
are for those that may use

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:04.939
the software afterwards.

00:01:05.509 --> 00:01:08.569
This could include both other
programmers and customers who want

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.350
a product which is simple to use.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:13.639
For example, you might
subscribe to the concept of a

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.390
‘minimal viable product’ [MVP].

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:19.640
This is where you aim to provide
the simplest product which will

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.520
fulfil the required criteria.

